  "type": "item",
  "name": {
    "ja": "Figure-rise Standard 仮面ライダーキバ キバフォーム",
    "en": "Figure-rise Standard Kamen Rider Kiva Kiva Form"
  },
  "price": {
    "amount": 4400,
    "currency": "JPY",
    "taxIncluded": true,
    "taxRate": 10
  },
  "releaseDate": {
    "ja": "2024年04月13日 (土)",
    "year": 2024,
    "month": 4,
    "day": 13
  },
  "targetAge": 15,
  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "「HEISEI RIDER PROJECT Beginning」遂にFINAL！",
      "en": "\"HEISEI RIDER PROJECT Beginning\" is finally FINAL!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "平成主人公仮面ライダープラモデル化プロジェクトのラストを飾るのは、『仮面ライダーキバ』より「仮面ライダーキバ キバフォーム」 ! キバっていくぜ！",
      "en": "The final product of the Heisei era main character Kamen Rider plastic model project is \"Kamen Rider Kiva Kiva Form \" from \" Kamen Rider Kiva\"! Let's move on!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• キバ特有のポージングを再現するため、腰、股関節の可動軸を再構築。股関節の内部パーツに連動して腰外装が可動することで、脚部の広範囲な可動を実現。",
      "en": "• The movable axes of the hips and hip joints have been rebuilt to reproduce Kiva's unique poses. By moving the exterior of the waist in conjunction with the internal parts of the hip joint, a wide range of movement of the legs is achieved."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• スーツは鏡面磨きとエクストラフィニッシュを採用。表面の粗さに違いをだして、全身のディテールを表現。",
      "en": "• The suit has a mirror polish and extra finish. The details of the whole body are expressed by varying the roughness of the surface."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 全身のアーマーに取りついた鎖は別パーツで再現し、立体感のあるリアルなディテールを追求。",
      "en": "• The chains attached to the entire body armor are reproduced as separate parts, pursuing realistic details with a three-dimensional feel."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 右脚のヘルズゲート開放状態をパーツの差し替えで再現。",
      "en": "• Reproduce the Hell's Gate open state of the right leg by replacing parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• キバットバットIII世は、ベルトからの脱着が可能。専用台座を使用することで浮遊状態を再現できる。",
      "en": "• Kivat Bat III can be attached and removed from the belt. By using a special pedestal, you can recreate the floating state."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ６種のフエッスルは１パーツごとに表現。フエッスロットへの収納が可能。フエッスル持ち手が付属しポーズ付けもできる。",
      "en": "• 6 types of Fuessuru are expressed in each part. Can be stored in the Fess slot. A fuessuru handle is included and can be posed."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 豊富なハンドパーツやFigure-rise Effect台座が付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with a variety of hand parts and a figure-rise effect pedestal."
    }
  ],
  "accessories": [
